{"seq":27,"ts":"2026-10-28T17:57:53.781Z","projectId":"project_7fcbbd09cc86433ca2350f34cb6cc9af","sessionId":"session_4bf32df99f9d47f3b36dcf0c73f9b5ee","causedBy":4,"v":1,"type":"chat.item","payload":{"item":{"kind":"message","role":"assistant","text":"Now I understand the codebase. Let me design the contract precisely before writing the plan. Key design decision for the shared `Totals` interface (owned by the cart task, consumed by the receipt task after it merges):\n\n- `totals(cart, code?)` stays backward-compatible; adds optional `discount` field.\n- Invariant `total = subtotal + shipping + (discount?.amount ?? 0)`, so FREESHIP keeps `shipping` at its normal value and expresses the waiver as a negative `discount` — which is exactly what lets the receipt render a `Discount (FREESHIP)` line.\n\nLet me write the plan artifact to a temp dir outside the repo and submit it."}}}
