h produce no discount field.\n  - Invariant: total = subtotal + shipping + (discount?.amount ?? 0).\n\nAdd tests in src/cart.test.ts covering: SAVE10 rounding down (pick a subtotal where 10% is not a whole cent, e.g. 2999 -> -299), FREESHIP waiving flat shipping under the threshold, FREESHIP producing NO discount field when shipping is already free (at/above threshold and empty cart), an unknown code throwing, and case-insensitivity (e.g. 'save10' behaves like 'SAVE10'). Keep the existing tests passing.\n\nRun `npm run ci` and ensure it passes (prettier format:check, tsc --noEmit, vitest). Keep code prettier-clean.","planNodeId":"cart-discount-pricing","parentSessionId":"session_4bf32df99f9d47f3b36dcf0c73f9b5ee","interface":"chat","createdAt":"2026-10-28T18:01:36.110Z"}}}
