{"seq":92,"ts":"2026-10-28T18:02:48.499Z","projectId":"project_7fcbbd09cc86433ca2350f34cb6cc9af","sessionId":"session_4bf32df99f9d47f3b36dcf0c73f9b5ee","planNodeId":"cart-discount-pricing","v":1,"type":"explain.note","payload":{"text":"Chose the invariant total = subtotal + shipping + (discount?.amount ?? 0), keeping shipping at its pre-discount value and expressing FREESHIP as a negative discount rather than zeroing shipping. This is what gives the receipt a 'Discount (FREESHIP)' line to render; zeroing shipping would leave nothing to show between Subtotal and Shipping. The threshold is checked on the pre-discount subtotal per the spec. totals(cart, code?) keeps the no-code call backward compatible so existing cart/receipt tests stay green.","source":"orchestrator"}}
