{"seq":203,"ts":"2026-10-28T18:29:39.137Z","projectId":"project_7fcbbd09cc86433ca2350f34cb6cc9af","sessionId":"session_01d49569084d4334baec28e88e945ca5","planNodeId":"receipt-discount-line","causedBy":160,"v":1,"type":"chat.item","payload":{"item":{"kind":"tool_call","tool":"Bash","inputSummary":"command: cd \"C:/Users/<user>/.helix-demo-run/worktrees/project_7fcbbd09cc86433ca2350f34cb6cc9af/session_01d49569084d4334baec28e88e945ca5\" && npm run ci 2>&1 | tail -30","outputSummary":"Output received (1408 characters)","status":"succeeded"}}}
{"seq":204,"ts":"2026-10-28T18:29:54.702Z","projectId":"project_7fcbbd09cc86433ca2350f34cb6cc9af","sessionId":"session_01d49569084d4334baec28e88e945ca5","planNodeId":"receipt-discount-line","causedBy":160,"v":1,"type":"chat.item","payload":{"item":{"kind":"message","role":"assistant","text":"CI passes — prettier clean, tsc clean, all 19 tests pass (6 in `receipt.test.ts`).\n\n## Summary\n\n**`src/receipt.ts`** — changed the signature to `receipt(cart: Cart, code?: string)`, passed `code` through to `totals(cart, code)`, and when the returned totals include a `discount`, inserted one line between Subtotal and Shipping:\n\n```ts\nif (t.discount) {\n  lines.push(line(`Discount (${t.discount.code})`, formatCents(t.discount.amount)));\n}\n```\n\nIt uses the existing `line()` helper and `WIDTH`, and `formatCents` already renders the negative sign. With no discount (no code, or a code that doesn't reduce the price) the output is byte-for-byte unchanged.\n\n**`src/receipt.test.ts`** — added four cases:\n- `SAVE10` shows `Discount (SAVE10)  -$2.40` in the right position.\n- `FREESHIP` shows `Discount (FREESHIP)  -$5.99`.\n- No code (`undefined`) yields the same string as the plain call.\n- `FREESHIP` on a cart that already ships free (no price reduction) yields the unchanged receipt.\n\nExisting cases still pass. I ran `npm install` first since `node_modules` wasn't present in this worktree. I did not touch `src/cart.ts` — the pricing/discount logic is consumed from its exported `totals`/`Totals`/`Discount` API."}}}
